{"absolute_url":"https://job-boards.greenhouse.io/kasisto/jobs/8462035002","data_compliance":[{"type":"gdpr","requires_consent":false,"requires_processing_consent":false,"requires_retention_consent":false,"retention_period":null,"demographic_data_consent_applies":false}],"internal_job_id":6380088002,"location":{"name":"New York City or Remote"},"metadata":null,"id":8462035002,"updated_at":"2026-03-13T12:08:26-04:00","requisition_id":null,"title":"Technical Project Manager, Agentic AI Delivery","pay_input_ranges":[],"company_name":"Kasisto","first_published":"2026-03-13T12:08:26-04:00","language":"en","application_deadline":null,"content":"\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;Kasisto is seeking a skilled and versatile Technical Project Manager to work with customers on the implementation of agentic applications for financial services. This role will include extensive customer communications as well as development of tools to accelerate implementation and integration with customer systems as part of the end-to-end production solution. This full time position can be based in our New York City office or fully remote.\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;em\u0026gt;We will consider only candidates who reside in New York, New Jersey, Massachusetts, Georgia, or Texas.\u0026lt;/em\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;h3\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;Key Responsibilities\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/h3\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;ul\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;Coordinate project activities from initial customer kick-off through successful production go-live and beyond.\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;Act as the primary liaison between the customer and Kasisto.\u0026amp;nbsp;\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;Participate in the discovery process with customers to capture their technical requirements and business objectives.\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;Identify project risks and mitigation options.\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;Drive consensus with the customer on project plans and timeframe.\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;Participate in project-specific development activities, either as the primary developer or contributing to a team effort.\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;Assist with validation of the complete solution in development, staging, and production environments.\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;Monitor and optimize deployments in response to evolving business needs.\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;Create and maintain the documentation archive specific to each implementation.\u0026amp;nbsp;\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;/ul\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;h3\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;Required Skills\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/h3\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;ul\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;At least 5 years of\u0026amp;nbsp; hands-on experience in project management, preferably in the financial services industry.\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;Experience implementing customer service automation, preferably solutions incorporating AI and ideally agentic AI.\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;Working knowledge of the regulatory, security, and governance needs of financial institutions.\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;Strong ability to communicate clearly with technical and non-technical stakeholders from the trenches to the C-suite.\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;General knowledge of Java or Python sufficient for building, enhancing, and debugging proprietary tools.\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;Comfortable with solving problems in a complex and ambiguous context.\u0026amp;nbsp;\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;Willingness to “wear many hats” and “roll up your sleeves” as is common in a fast-paced, nimble company such as ours.\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science, Engineering, or a related field.\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;/ul\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;h3\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;Desired Skills\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/h3\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;ul\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;Proficiency with AWS and Azure environments.\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;Capable of building production-ready scripts or code for data manipulation and API integration, either directly or using AI tools.\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;Experience with banking platforms such as Candescent, Q2, FIS, and Jack Henry.\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;Familiarity with voice systems and modern telephony.\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;Understanding of contact center architecture and operations.\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;Conversational Spanish fluency, ideally as a native speaker.\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;/ul\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;h3\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;What We Offer\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/h3\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;ul\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;Base salary of $110,000 to $130,000, commensurate with experience.\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;Comprehensive benefits package.\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;Collaborative work environment within a small team focused on delivery projects.\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;Hands-on experience with leading AI technology.\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;/ul\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;em\u0026gt;Unfortunately, we are unable to provide visa sponsorship now or at any time in the future, and relocation assistance will not be provided.\u0026lt;/em\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;h3\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;About Kasisto\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/h3\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;Kasisto delivers AI you can bank on. We enable financial institutions around the world to deploy intelligent digital agents that are trusted, compliant, and deeply knowledgeable about assisting both employees and customers. Our agentic AI platform, KAIgentic, allows organizations to tap into a wide range of knowledge sources and integrate with their operational infrastructure, enabling conversational assistance through websites, mobile apps, and voice communications.\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;","departments":[{"id":4002872002,"name":"Engineering - Solutions Delivery ","child_ids":[],"parent_id":null}],"offices":[],"ai_disclaimer":null,"include_ai_disclaimer":null,"ai_opt_out_request_url":null,"compliance":null,"demographic_questions":null,"questions":[{"description":null,"label":"First Name","required":true,"fields":[{"name":"first_name","type":"input_text","values":[]}]},{"description":null,"label":"Last Name","required":true,"fields":[{"name":"last_name","type":"input_text","values":[]}]},{"description":null,"label":"Preferred First Name","required":false,"fields":[{"name":"preferred_name","type":"input_text","values":[]}]},{"description":null,"label":"Email","required":true,"fields":[{"name":"email","type":"input_text","values":[]}]},{"description":null,"label":"Phone","required":true,"fields":[{"name":"phone","type":"input_text","values":[]}]},{"description":null,"label":"Resume/CV","required":true,"fields":[{"name":"resume","type":"input_file","values":[]},{"name":"resume_text","type":"textarea","values":[]}]},{"description":null,"label":"Cover Letter","required":false,"fields":[{"name":"cover_letter","type":"input_file","values":[]},{"name":"cover_letter_text","type":"textarea","values":[]}]},{"description":null,"label":"LinkedIn Profile","required":true,"fields":[{"name":"question_35690398002","type":"input_text","values":[]}]},{"description":null,"label":"In what state do you reside?","required":true,"fields":[{"name":"question_35690582002","type":"multi_value_single_select","values":[{"label":"New York","value":236585618002},{"label":"New Jersey","value":236592909002},{"label":"Massachusetts","value":236585619002},{"label":"Georgia","value":236585620002},{"label":"Texas","value":236585621002},{"label":"Other","value":236585622002}]}]},{"description":null,"label":"Do you now or will you ever require visa sponsorship to work in the United States?","required":true,"fields":[{"name":"question_35690399002","type":"multi_value_single_select","values":[{"label":"Yes","value":1},{"label":"No","value":0}]}]},{"description":null,"label":"In a sentence or two, what distinguishes you as an outstanding candidate for this role?","required":false,"fields":[{"name":"question_35690400002","type":"textarea","values":[]}]}],"location_questions":[{"description":null,"label":"Longitude","required":true,"fields":[{"name":"longitude","type":"input_hidden","values":[]}]},{"description":null,"label":"Latitude","required":true,"fields":[{"name":"latitude","type":"input_hidden","values":[]}]},{"description":null,"label":"Location","required":true,"fields":[{"name":"location","type":"input_text","values":[]}]}]}